(6986963, 1054730, 53147, '<td valign="top">So I opened this up before voting. I actually read the whole thing before trying to correlate it to the challenge. I was confused. I couldn''t connect the image with the title with the challenge. Why would you write a letter on a shopping list and then enter that into a challenge? And then it clicked. I can be very slow. Brought out an audible laugh. Extra points for making me work for it and making that work worth while.</td>', 'So I opened this up before voting. I actually read the whole thing before trying to correlate it to the challenge. I was confused. I couldn''t connect the image with the title with the challenge. Why would you write a letter on a shopping list and then enter that into a challenge? And then it clicked. I can be very slow. Brought out an audible laugh. Extra points for making me work for it and making that work worth while.', '2013-02-27 06:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
