(6992630, 1054730, 129807, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by timfythetoo:</b></div><hr/><i> So I opened this up before voting. I actually read the whole thing before trying to correlate it to the challenge. I was confused. I couldn''t connect the image with the title with the challenge. Why would you write a letter on a shopping list and then enter that into a challenge? And then it clicked. I can be very slow. Brought out an audible laugh. Extra points for making me work for it and making that work worth while. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yep, this about sums up what I did too. The image, as Bear said, leaves a little to be desired, but the concept - awesome!</td>', 'Originally posted by timfythetoo: So I opened this up before voting. I actually read the whole thing before trying to correlate it to the challenge. I was confused. I couldn''t connect the image with the title with the challenge. Why would you write a letter on a shopping list and then enter that into a challenge? And then it clicked. I can be very slow. Brought out an audible laugh. Extra points for making me work for it and making that work worth while.   Yep, this about sums up what I did too. The image, as Bear said, leaves a little to be desired, but the concept - awesome!', '2013-03-06 00:08:43.000000', NULL, 0),
