(6992767, 1055383, 100495, '<td valign="top">I could actually see this hanging behind the bar of a French bar, while Francois blows cigarette smoke towards Jacqueline in an effort to woo her. Placing her Pernod on the bar she gives him a wry smile and walks slowly out the door, glancing back at Francois then heading toward her arrondissement in the cool Parissienne evening. Does he follow?<br/> <br/>No, there''s a fat German woman with a packet of crisps and a Stein of lager and he goes to bother her instead. Much easier pickings!</td>', 'I could actually see this hanging behind the bar of a French bar, while Francois blows cigarette smoke towards Jacqueline in an effort to woo her. Placing her Pernod on the bar she gives him a wry smile and walks slowly out the door, glancing back at Francois then heading toward her arrondissement in the cool Parissienne evening. Does he follow? No, there''s a fat German woman with a packet of crisps and a Stein of lager and he goes to bother her instead. Much easier pickings!', '2013-03-06 03:42:00.000000', NULL, 0),
